flowchart TD
    Start([User Opens Planetary Defense What-If Lab]) --> LoadDefaults[Load Default Parameters: d=100m, v=20km/s, rho=2500kg/m3]
    LoadDefaults --> UserInput{User Action}
    
    UserInput -- Select Preset --> ApplyPreset[Load Scenario: Chelyabinsk / Tunguska / Dimorphos]
    ApplyPreset --> CalculatePhysics
    
    UserInput -- Adjust Sliders --> UpdateSlider[Modify Diameter, Velocity, or Density Slider]
    UpdateSlider --> CalculatePhysics
    
    UserInput -- Adjust Miss Distance --> UpdateMissDistance[Update Illustrative Miss Distance Display]
    UpdateMissDistance --> DecoupledNotice[Maintain Decoupling: Zero Impact on Kinetic Energy]
    DecoupledNotice --> UserInput
    
    subgraph PhysicsEngine["Deterministic Classical Physics Engine"]
        CalculatePhysics[Validate Parameters: d > 0, v > 0, rho > 0]
        CalculatePhysics --> Radius["r = d / 2  (meters)"]
        Radius --> Volume["V = (4/3) * pi * r^3  (cubic meters)"]
        Volume --> Mass["m = rho * V  (kilograms)"]
        Mass --> Velocity["v_ms = v_kms * 1000  (meters/second)"]
        Velocity --> EnergyJoules["E_k = 0.5 * m * (v_ms)^2  (Joules)"]
        EnergyJoules --> TNTConversion["Convert to Kilotons (4.184e12 J) & Megatons (4.184e15 J)"]
    end
    
    TNTConversion --> RenderOutputs[Update Kinetic Energy Readouts & Recharts Curves]
    RenderOutputs --> UpdateSensitivity[Recalculate Parameter Sensitivity Multipliers: 8x, 4x, 2x]
    UpdateSensitivity --> LogSim[Log asteroid_simulation_completed Telemetry Event]
    LogSim --> UserInput
    
    UserInput -- Save Bookmark --> SaveAsteroid[Bookmark Asteroid in Space Vault]
    SaveAsteroid --> UserInput

